Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.42,0:00:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shiva城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.46,0:00:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不,那是蜃氣樓
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shiva城堡就這樣迎賓
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.76,0:00:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們是被選中的,這個計劃的委託人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.73,0:00:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,計算過我們各自的才能才把各人找來的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,為了得到財寶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那, Cobra,你的才能是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.81,0:00:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼選你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因為我曾去過一次那個城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,神殿的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.81,0:02:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,靠近陸地了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.47,0:02:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,水在變淺
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.36,0:02:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看,森林
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.27,0:02:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是大Shiva帝國的, Saldora
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.84,0:03:00.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,森林前方有個Saldora神殿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.53,0:03:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,通往Shiva城堡的地下水道就在神殿正下方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.05,0:03:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這個森林被叫做妖精森林
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.21,0:03:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這是Saldora最美的地方,我在這出生的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.78,0:03:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是過去了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,別忘了,現在這裡是在混沌軍隊統治下的戰場
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.50,0:03:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妖精森林
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.25,0:03:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我看來就是一堆怪物等著我們
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.40,0:03:39.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這是什麼鬼地方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.49,0:03:42.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra, 幹啥呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.85,0:03:44.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,釣魚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.76,0:03:47.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,7， 真是悠閒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.69,0:03:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們不是來這遠足,野營的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.63,0:03:52.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們是來打仗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.94,0:04:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這什麼玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.67,0:04:10.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心點哦, 小船周圍他們有很多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.47,0:04:11.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,混沌兵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.76,0:04:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等下,他們不是混沌兵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.11,0:04:14.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米卡塔喲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.18,0:04:16.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,本地人(???)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.39,0:04:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,森裡裡的本地抵抗軍
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.89,0:04:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,納尼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.31,0:04:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂, 你吃過蛙腿嗎, 不錯哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.34,0:04:50.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊拉, 我還不知你吃過法國料理
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.01,0:04:52.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,烏魯賽, 閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.82,0:04:55.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你個破顯示器
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.09,0:04:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你再說一次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.89,0:04:59.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就作在這,容許他放肆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.36,0:05:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這個嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.08,0:05:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你這y, 想幹架
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.68,0:05:07.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,X你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.75,0:05:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在阻止她
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.05,0:05:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.15,0:05:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra, 不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.37,0:05:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地下水道的入口好像被封鎖了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.87,0:05:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,納尼, 那怎麼辦才好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.84,0:05:25.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地下水道的入口在Saldora神殿下方
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們只好從那下去開門
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.35,0:05:31.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是說我們要到Saldoro城區,在混沌軍隊面前拋頭露面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.68,0:05:37.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這不是為我們寫輓歌嗎, 你還正常嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.68,0:05:38.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.18,0:05:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.01,0:05:45.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,讓她去, Ellis有特殊能力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.91,0:06:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等, Ellis!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.95,0:06:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去神殿, 然後開門
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.52,0:06:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黎明前等著我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.73,0:06:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用擔心, 彼女的話沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.05,0:06:26.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,20年前,我迷失了記憶, 就在這個森林徘徊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.55,0:06:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,彼女救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.45,0:06:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個妖精
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.99,0:06:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra, 睡著了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.62,0:06:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了,8號
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.04,0:06:58.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字是Judy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.96,0:07:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個, Cobra,能和我組隊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.85,0:07:08.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Jack這人落入邪道了, 那個女人又是個殺手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管是那個丟失記憶的怪物巨人, 還是那個妖精
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.52,0:07:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能相信他們
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.46,0:07:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能讓我信任的人只有你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.57,0:07:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你有7作同伴了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.85,0:07:25.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Frank, 這個男人是個廢柴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.51,0:07:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他只會說, 毫無用處
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.59,0:07:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我現在就給你看看這y多蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.50,0:07:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那還是1年前,我們還有各自的身體
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.52,0:07:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Frank 和我潛入芝加哥一家銀行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.06,0:07:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Frank, 快點, 就要到守衛換班了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.42,0:07:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,閉嘴可以嗎, 你一直在一旁瞎說, 我都無法專心開鎖了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.81,0:07:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.33,0:07:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是你拜託我陪你來的, 說你一個人沒有自信
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.40,0:07:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,馬路野狼,我怎麼可能說那種話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:08:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All you did is tag along!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.22,0:08:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.52,0:08:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.83,0:08:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,西瑪塔,我剪了旁邊的線
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.29,0:08:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,誒, 會怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.88,0:08:15.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣我們2個都被炸成了碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.14,0:08:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我得到了Shiva城堡的財寶,我就可以得到一個有血有肉的身體了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.29,0:08:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是有錢的話, 你甚至可以得到一個女性人類的身體.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.19,0:08:28.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就可以和你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.00,0:08:34.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra, 看我,以前的身體
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.00,0:08:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有錢了,先吧自己升級到彩色TV吧.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.31,0:08:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼,我最在意那個了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.46,0:08:56.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,神殿的僧侶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.46,0:09:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了 King?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.70,0:09:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ellis, Ellis 被抓了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.22,0:09:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,King!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.62,0:09:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,別去,King, 別一個人去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.27,0:09:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,King朝神殿去了, 追上他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.28,0:09:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.68,0:09:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Q, 上潛水艇
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.14,0:09:46.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們在神殿下面會合
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.86,0:10:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到神殿了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,慘了,機械獸在
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.62,0:10:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們可沒法靠近這些傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.54,0:10:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都到這裡了,別抱怨了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.90,0:10:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,讓我們衝進去, 趕緊打開水門
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.11,0:10:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,馬大大
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.00,0:10:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們不知 King和Ellis的去向
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.92,0:10:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先去找到那2人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.24,0:10:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重金懸賞者, 你什麼時候開始關心你的同伴了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.60,0:10:39.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,過去開了水門是正確, 那之後呢,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.79,0:10:42.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有King才知道怎麼去Shiva城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.31,0:10:46.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,7，成步堂, 你是說他是必須的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.01,0:10:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們分頭尋找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.34,0:10:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,30分鐘後還是這裡匯合
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.01,0:10:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心哦 Cobra.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.82,0:10:56.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可能不小心擊斃你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.76,0:11:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,給你暗號.. 90, 60, 90.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那啥呀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.32,0:11:10.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你居然母雞, Marilyn Monroe(瑪麗蓮夢露)的3唯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.65,0:11:14.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Monroe的三維?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,對不住啊, 需要借下衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.03,0:11:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊,這是啥呀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.60,0:11:57.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,令人驚歎啊, 他居然有辦法對付那些機械獸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.88,0:12:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,King!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.77,0:12:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你還在這磨蹭什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.15,0:12:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你沒聽到嗎,我們得去找他們
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.31,0:12:10.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,別說了, 我是上流社會人士, 你懂得
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.46,0:12:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這些事情就交給那幫人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.60,0:12:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不相信你是這樣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.90,0:12:17.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你個軟蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,90!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.27,0:12:19.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,60!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.87,0:12:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,暗號
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.59,0:12:25.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個Monroe的三維是多少來著
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.21,0:12:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我他媽怎麼可能知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.54,0:12:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,繼續, 臀部的大小
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.00,0:12:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的是87cm
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.42,0:12:36.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,King被帶入神殿了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.48,0:12:38.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ellis則母雞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.34,0:12:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喲西, 進神殿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,穿上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.95,0:12:53.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.12,0:12:57.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,馬路野狼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.33,0:12:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你他媽在幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.90,0:13:02.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是為了不可疑, 給他們打招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.56,0:13:10.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能看到裡面的光, 那邊有什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.69,0:13:21.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ellis!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.82,0:13:35.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,賜給我們榮光與興盛的黑暗之神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.77,0:13:37.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,偉大的神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.73,0:13:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們獻上這個處女
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.16,0:13:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他說活祭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.35,0:13:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可是第一次看這個
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.95,0:13:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是, 第一次看到處女
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.24,0:13:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,7，8， 吸引他們注意
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.14,0:13:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊,怎麼弄
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.00,0:14:05.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們的神, 黑暗之神, 在我們面前獻身吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.18,0:14:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這個行得通嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.73,0:14:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這個可以有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.01,0:14:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他們過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.63,0:14:57.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ellis, 有受傷嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.22,0:14:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.45,0:15:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,hoho,僧侶全滅了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.27,0:15:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra, 看,那就是水門
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.21,0:15:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這個與通向地下水道的門相連
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.54,0:15:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成步堂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.55,0:15:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打開了這個, 我們就打開地下水道了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.62,0:15:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,令人驚訝, 真是個有趣的設備
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.14,0:15:22.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們得要個地球人體才能打開這個
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這就是他們要獻活祭的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.91,0:15:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣說來,我們打擾他們開門了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.55,0:15:35.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,獻身吧, Cobra, 為了同伴們
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.94,0:15:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.55,0:15:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不是處女哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.14,0:15:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和處女無關
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.73,0:15:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是血, 打開需要的是血
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.66,0:15:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,本來是想完成後再幹掉你, 看來我不得不在這動手了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.99,0:15:57.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,為同伴報仇?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.28,0:15:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,承認吧,這可不像你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.79,0:16:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呀麼跌, 你們2個SX
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.31,0:16:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大祭司, Engola.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.27,0:16:21.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他雖然加入了混沌軍勢, 怎麼說也是個人類
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.85,0:16:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是想我說謝謝, 還是要我的寬恕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.84,0:16:30.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就別了, 那也不是我的風格
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.36,0:16:34.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看,血
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.54,0:16:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,門上的鎖解開了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.13,0:16:45.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好, 門開了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.89,0:16:47.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但還有件事我很在意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.73,0:16:48.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.69,0:16:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大祭司先前說
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.59,0:16:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是說什麼 黑暗之神, 在我們面前獻身吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.68,0:16:55.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,別傻了, 哪有神
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.14,0:16:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊,說曹操..
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.98,0:17:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,King!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.16,0:17:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,趴下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.41,0:17:23.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,納尼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.04,0:17:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的身體是能量體
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.84,0:17:28.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,槍沒用,跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.86,0:17:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去基地
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.90,0:17:36.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Queen應該到那了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.73,0:17:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.63,0:17:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,門開了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.23,0:17:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,水門開了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.72,0:18:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,剛才你看到了嗎, 那是多拉工(dragon)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.72,0:18:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.25,0:18:08.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這裡他媽的怎麼會有多拉工
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.88,0:18:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都問你想說啥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.67,0:18:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra! 這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.69,0:19:05.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,King!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.74,0:19:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下潛, 全速前進
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.23,0:19:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ellis, 快點
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.91,0:19:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坐穩了,我們出發
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.09,0:19:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:35.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra, 我們沒動啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.93,0:19:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,靠,是機械獸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.83,0:19:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是地下軍 來救我們了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.84,0:20:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,水面在變亮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.38,0:20:21.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們進入湖了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.77,0:20:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,King, 堅持住! King!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.31,0:20:31.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra, 照我說的做
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.56,0:20:34.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,城堡就在那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.11,0:20:47.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像是個湖,但全是霧,什麼都看不見
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.46,0:21:01.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我們碰到岸邊了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.17,0:21:02.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喲西,我去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.87,0:21:05.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,King, 正如你所說
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.97,0:21:09.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.18,0:21:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他昏迷了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.16,0:21:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算是King, 受這個傷也...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.66,0:21:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,照看King,我去外面看看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.57,0:21:27.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Romila... Romila! 別死
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.68,0:21:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,King, 你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.07,0:21:31.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是想起了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.81,0:21:33.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恢復記憶了?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.38,0:21:38.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那時,城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.57,0:23:22.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,目標,Shiva城堡, 就在眼前了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.57,0:23:25.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看來King開始想起過去了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.78,0:23:28.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,連同他悲慘的過去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.93,0:23:32.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他深愛的Romila在他面前被害
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.49,0:23:37.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兇手左手是把槍
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.36,0:23:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看來要奪取Shiva城堡,還有很多曲折
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.42,0:23:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下集 Cobra The Animation: 遙遠的記憶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.04,0:23:48.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,夜露死苦
